# Crystal Imperium balance test: Bugsy (trainer 404) at the badge-1 level cap (16), where all of
# his Pokemon are since 0.7.0. Team: Quilava / Geodude / Flaaffy / Pidgey, Quilava holding the
# first care package's Charcoal, never switching voluntarily (a deliberately naive line). Twelve
# battles with different RNG must include at least one win (winnable with Pokemon caught before
# Azalea) and at least one loss (not a free badge). Measured on mGBA: no items 5 of 20, the
# Charcoal 9 of 20, Charcoal, two Eviolites and a Focus Sash 12 of 12 (a free badge).
!new_game()
!battle_style_set()
!give_mon(156, 16)
!give_mon(74, 16)
!give_mon(180, 16)
!give_mon(16, 16)
!hold_item("ITEM_CHARCOAL", 0)
savestate team.ss
!battle_trainer(404)
wait 1100
expect16 {gBattleMons+136} 167 bugsy_leads_spinarak
# Quilava Ember, Geodude Rock Throw, Flaaffy Thunder Shock, Pidgey Gust
!sample_battle(404, "2,3,1,2", runs=12, min_wins=1, max_wins=11)
